        ("SQL vs NoSQL?", "SQL uses fixed relational schemas and joins; NoSQL (like MongoDB) uses flexible documents and scales horizontally."),
        ("What is BSON?", "Binary JSON format with extra types (dates, ObjectId) used by MongoDB."),
        ("Embedding vs referencing?", "Embed for data read together and bounded size; reference for large, shared or unbounded data."),
